	(text "Touch: CST816D, I2C 0x15. Motion: SC7A20, I2C 0x18.\nSC7A20 pin 4 MUST connect GND; pin 11 NC.\nBacklight HIGH=ON. R13 starts at 5.1 ohm; 0 ohm only after current/thermal test.\nJ1 bottom-contact orientation and final position require a screen sample."
